    "raw_text": "\n<think>\nmulti-dimensional analysis:\nLet me analyze this video based on the provided frames and the text prompt.\n\nThe text prompt asks for: \"生成一段15秒、4:3横屏的黏土定格动画服装剧情短片，采用黏土定格动画风格\" (Generate a 15-second, 4:3 landscape clay stop-motion clothing drama short film in clay stop-motion style).\n\nLooking at the frames:\n\nVisual Quality Analysis:\n- The overall visual quality is moderate. The renderings are coherent with decent lighting and clear details, but they do not reach high-end realism or exceptional polish.\n- The character design remains consistent across frames, with believable fabric textures and stable shading; no major distortions or artifacts are evident.\n- Transitions between frames are smooth, and the environment (library setting) is well-rendered with convincing depth cues.\n- Overall, Visual Quality aligns with a mid-range assessment rather than an outstanding one.\n\nText-to-Video Alignment Analysis:\n- The video largely satisfies the prompt requirements: it is a 15-second, 4:3 landscape piece featuring a woman in a plaid coat with a belt, presented in a clay stop-motion aesthetic within a library setting.\n- The sequence shows the character moving through the space, interacting with the door, and the environment maintains coherence with the requested scenario.\n- There are only minor deviations in pacing or framing that prevent a perfect match, resulting in strong but not flawless alignment.\n\nPhysical/Common-sense Consistency:\n- The scene generally adheres to plausible physics and common-sense expectations: the character’s proportions, clothing behavior, and interactions with the door and surroundings feel believable.\n- A few micro-motions or timing nuances could be refined, but there are no glaring inconsistencies that break immersion.\n\nOverall assessment:\n- The video demonstrates solid technical execution and faithful adherence to the prompt, with moderate visual quality, strong alignment to the requested scenario, and generally sound physical consistency.\n</think>\n\n(1) visual quality: 3\n(2) text-to-video alignment: 4\n(3) physical/common-sense consistency: 3\n"
